      "bookmarkId": "41101412_25_18463-18509",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "18463-18509",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这就是宰我，一个聪明、爱耍嘴皮子，虽然有时候喜欢质疑老师，但在行动上又尊师重道的言语科学生。",
      "totalCount": 2808
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 62467151,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_22_4838-4873",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "4838-4873",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所以，各位家长看见了吗？想要让自己的孩子赢在起跑线上，自己得先跑起来！",
      "totalCount": 2190
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 931432049,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_21_8380-8431",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "8380-8431",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "据说，交干肉就能成为孔子的学生，这就是所谓的束脩(xiū)之礼。",
      "totalCount": 2064
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 336130981,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_22_14820-14854",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "14820-14854",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "子路会把陷入困境视作自己的问题，然后开始自我怀疑，这是不自信的表现。",
      "totalCount": 2064
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 210591327,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_21_4095-4201",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "4095-4201",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "因为他出生在尼丘山，所以叫孔丘；又因为他在家里排行第二，而在古代的家庭中，兄弟长幼排序依次为伯、仲、叔、季，所以他字仲尼。",
      "totalCount": 1770
    },
    {
