      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "3772-3849",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "孔子教给弟子礼、乐、射、御、数、书六项技能，它们合起来称为六艺。",
      "totalCount": 1422
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 329502804,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_25_12647-12716",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "12647-12716",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "子闻之，曰：“成事不说，遂事不谏，既往不咎。” ——《论语·八佾》",
      "totalCount": 1404
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 401033003,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_22_9543-9608",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "9543-9608",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这就是成语闻一知十的出处，意思是通过一件事物，能发散开来，想到更多相关的事物。",
      "totalCount": 1377
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 403220663,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_22_12809-12848",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "12809-12848",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "别人夹菜你转桌，别人打牌你自摸，别人的隐私你乱说，这是非常没有共情能力的表现。",
      "totalCount": 1340
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 25713348,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_21_9293-9413",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "9293-9413",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "子曰：“有教无类。” ——《论语·卫灵公》 孔子说：“人人我都教育，没有（贫富、地域、身份等方面的）区别。”",
      "totalCount": 1290
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 931432049,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_22_20261-20284",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "20261-20284",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "既能在贫穷中自得其乐，也不会因苦难而改变志向。",
      "totalCount": 1230
    },
    {
      "bookId": "41101412",
      "userVid": 25713348,
      "bookmarkId": "41101412_25_14709-14788",
